flowchart LR
    subgraph Clients[RTMP Clients]
        OBS1[OBS / FFmpeg<br/>Stream 1]
        OBS2[OBS / FFmpeg<br/>Stream 2]
        OBS3[OBS / FFmpeg<br/>Stream N]
    end

    subgraph K8sCluster[Kubernetes Cluster (namespace: media)]
        subgraph Proxy[RTMP Proxy Pod(s)]
            Nginx[NGINX-RTMP<br/>application live]
            FFmpegPool[FFmpeg per Stream<br/>(1 processo por stream)]
            Exporter[RTMP Stats Exporter<br/>(Python HTTP /metrics)]
        end

        subgraph Controller[Controller API Pod]
            FastAPI[FastAPI + Kubernetes Client<br/>/allocate, /release, /status]
        end

        subgraph Workers[RTMP Worker Pods]
            Worker1[Worker Pod 1<br/>nginx-rtmp + exporter]
            Worker2[Worker Pod 2]
            WorkerN[Worker Pod N]
        end

        subgraph PrometheusNS[Monitoring Namespace]
            Prometheus[Prometheus Server]
        end

        subgraph KEDA_NS[KEDA]
            KEDA[KEDA Operator]
        end
    end

    YouTube[(YouTube RTMP Endpoint<br/>rtmp://mediaserver.eadmeeting.com/LiveApp/KEY)]

    %% Connections
    OBS1 -->|RTMP publish<br/>rtmp://proxy:1935/live/stream1| Nginx
    OBS2 -->|RTMP publish| Nginx
    OBS3 -->|RTMP publish| Nginx

    Nginx -->|exec_publish<br/>on_publish_start.sh $name| FFmpegPool
    FFmpegPool -->|HTTP /allocate?stream={name}| FastAPI
    FastAPI -->|K8s API<br/>list/get pods<br/>patch deployment scale| Workers

    FFmpegPool -->|RTMP relay per stream<br/>rtmp://worker-x/live/{stream}| Workers

    Workers -->|push RTMP<br/>live2/KEY| YouTube

    Nginx -->|/stats| Exporter
    Exporter -->|/metrics| Prometheus
    Workers -->|/metrics| Prometheus

    Prometheus -->|Prometheus triggers| KEDA
    KEDA -->|HPA ScaledObject| Proxy
